  "files": [{"path": "index.html", "content": "<section class=\"blog\"><h2>最新文章</h2><p class=\"sub\">深度内容,每周更新</p><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"card\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/b1/400/250\" alt=\"\"><div class=\"body\"><span class=\"tag\">技术</span><h3>Vue3 组合式 API 完全实战指南</h3><p>从 Options API 平滑迁移到 Composition API 的完整路径与踩坑记录...</p><div class=\"meta\"><img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/32?img=1\" alt=\"\"><span>张伟</span><span>·</span><span>2026-04-15</span><span>·</span><span>8 分钟</span></div></div></article><article class=\"card\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/b2/400/250\" alt=\"\"><div class=\"body\"><span class=\"tag tag-2\">设计</span><h3>2026 年 UI 设计趋势:极简主义与微交互</h3><p>回归本质,用最少的元素传递最强的信息层次感...</p><div class=\"meta\"><img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/32?img=5\" alt=\"\"><span>李娜</span><span>·</span><span>2026-04-12</span><span>·</span><span>6 分钟</span></div></div></article><article class=\"card\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/b3/400/250\" alt=\"\"><div class=\"body\"><span class=\"tag tag-3\">产品</span><h3>如何设计一个让用户『上瘾』的产品</h3><p>从钩子模型出发,剖析触发、行动、奖励、投入的产品闭环...</p><div class=\"meta\"><img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/32?img=8\" alt=\"\"><span>王强</span><span>·</span><span>2026-04-10</span><span>·</span><span>10 分钟</span></div></div></article><article class=\"card\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/b4/400/250\" alt=\"\"><div class=\"body\"><span class=\"tag\">技术</span><h3>Rust vs Go:后端选型的深度对比</h3><p>从性能、生态、学习曲线、团队适配四个维度全面评估...</p><div class=\"meta\"><img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/32?img=11\" alt=\"\"><span>陈明</span><span>·</span><span>2026-04-08</span><span>·</span><span>12 分钟</span></div></div></article><article class=\"card\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/b5/400/250\" alt=\"\"><div class=\"body\"><span class=\"tag tag-3\">产品</span><h3>为什么 MVP 不应该追求『最小』</h3><p>真正的 MVP 是最小可验证产品,验证价值假设而非功能清单...</p><div class=\"meta\"><img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/32?img=13\" alt=\"\"><span>赵红</span><span>·</span><span>2026-04-05</span><span>·</span><span>7 分钟</span></div></div></article><article class=\"card\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/b6/400/250\" alt=\"\"><div class=\"body\"><span class=\"tag tag-2\">设计</span><h3>色彩心理学:品牌配色的 5 个黄金原则</h3><p>为什么金融品牌偏爱蓝色?为什么餐饮品牌常用红色?...</p><div class=\"meta\"><img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/32?img=15\" alt=\"\"><span>林芳</span><span>·</span><span>2026-04-02</span><span>·</span><span>5 分钟</span></div></div></article></div></section><style>*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}body{background:#f8fafc;padding:60px 20px;color:#0f172a}.blog{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto}h2{text-align:center;font-size:2.25rem;margin-bottom:8px}.sub{text-align:center;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:40px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:24px}.card{background:#fff;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s;cursor:pointer}.card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}.card img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/10;object-fit:cover;display:block}.body{padding:20px 22px}.tag{display:inline-block;background:#e0e7ff;color:#4338ca;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:12px}.tag-2{background:#fce7f3;color:#be185d}.tag-3{background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e}.card h3{margin-bottom:10px;font-size:1.125rem;line-height:1.4}.card p{color:#64748b;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:16px}.meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:13px;color:#94a3b8}.meta img{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%}</style>"}],
